# RISC-V 5-Stage Pipelined Processor (RV32I)

![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/tests-16%2F16%20passing-brightgreen)
![HDL](https://img.shields.io/badge/HDL-Verilog-blue)
![ISA](https://img.shields.io/badge/ISA-RV32I-orange)
![Sim](https://img.shields.io/badge/simulator-Vivado%20XSim-red)

A 32-bit RISC-V processor implementing the RV32I base instruction set on a classic 5-stage pipeline (IF → ID → EX → MEM → WB), written in Verilog and simulated on Xilinx Vivado XSim.

<!-- Add a block diagram of your pipeline here. Export from Vivado's schematic view,
